  "permlink": "https://cafe.daum.net/sedu22/fMHu/463",
  "contentHtml": "<div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignLeft\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/c9b3a347c7f091a23190a14d0257e2ecc61c926d\" class=\"txc-image\" width=\"524\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/c9b3a347c7f091a23190a14d0257e2ecc61c926d\" data-origin-width=\"920\" data-origin-height=\"569\"></div><p>&#160;</p><p>물체의 거리에 따른 수정체의 변화를&#160;</p><p>실험으로 보여주고 싶었는데,</p><p>기존의 광학실험장치세트 가격이 많이 비싸네요.</p><p>&#160;</p><p>제가 필요한 것은 굴절률이 다른 이런 종류의 렌즈입니다.</p><p>근처 교구사장님께 실험의 목적을 설명드리니</p><p>맞춤형 렌즈들과 레이저로 구성된</p><p>맞춤형 수정체 실험장치를 만들어 주시네요~ (가격도 1/10가격입니다)</p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignLeft\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/130aa0d9dca202a9a2c85b47e539a681177d68b2\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/130aa0d9dca202a9a2c85b47e539a681177d68b2\" data-origin-width=\"454\" data-origin-height=\"365\"></div><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignLeft\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/6bc4b847ccf74dd822f28d9c56205e0e5595ea95\" class=\"txc-image\" width=\"660\" height=\"288\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/6bc4b847ccf74dd822f28d9c56205e0e5595ea95\" data-origin-width=\"1119\" data-origin-height=\"488\"></div><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/b8295858f969a40a1391fe69228bf60b6f625baa\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/b8295858f969a40a1391fe69228bf60b6f625baa\" data-origin-width=\"1124\" data-origin-height=\"444\"></div><p>&#160;</p><p>거래하는 교구업체에</p><p>00 실험용 맞춤형 교구가 필요하다고 요청해보세요.</p><p>만들어 주실 겁니다~</p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignLeft\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/080915786624ff86b6a75da89a24b4200e092c25\" class=\"txc-image\" width=\"500\" height=\"282\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/080915786624ff86b6a75da89a24b4200e092c25\" data-origin-width=\"1600\" data-origin-height=\"901\"></div>\n\t \t\t\t\t\t<!-- -->",
